From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtl837x-gsw: add trunk, EEE, STP, IGMP, jumbo frame, and SFP
 DDM swconfig controls

Add swconfig port isolation default portmask (0x3FF), trunk/EEE/STP/IGMP handlers, jumbo frame configuration, and integer fixed-point SFP DDM readouts.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 src/rtl837x_common.h   |   8 +
 src/rtl837x_swconfig.c | 736 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 736 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

